```mdl
verdict F-3.2: Open files are not closed, but their nodes go briefly to the pending state during a manual refresh.
  status: partial
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-file-system/src/capabilities/state/FileSystemManager.ts#refreshWorkspaceContent]
  note: |
    `refreshWorkspaceContent` evicts all docs before the async disk re-scan. The open node's data flips to `null`
    (`markdown-pending`) until `syncFromDisk` re-binds it through the xattr or filemap. If that lookup fails, a new Text object is
    created, so the open editor ends up on a different object. The watcher path (`handleDirectoryRefresh`) evicts after the scan,
    so the gap is shorter. No test.
```

